{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國中期選舉結果陸續揭曉，媒體預料民主黨有望取得參眾兩院控制權。</p><p>美國總統特朗普周二（3日）接受《紐約時報》訪問時說，「絕對願接受結果」，也期望與民主黨合作。</p><p>（紐約時報）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T04:44:56.519928+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":86,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T04:26:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T05:18:36.315848+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T04:38:24.405404+00:00","content_hash":"339350d0fd690d1aafdc412bd6863505e038b975fbaf562b496d8be0ce68fec7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}